#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:0321"
msgid "Toran, you have been accused of blasphemy against our Lady Mordea and sentenced to death by beheading... Do you have any final words? "
msgstr ""

#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:0396"
msgid "I shall die as I have lived... with honor.  When I face Lithos, he will not find -me- wanting. "
msgstr ""

#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:03FC"
msgid "A man of honor would not have insulted his Lady with seditious rumors, knave! "
msgstr ""

#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:04EA"
msgid "I fear that Lithos will not find you at all... for your grave shall be a watery one.  The Lurker is not kind to the ones she... acquires. "
msgstr ""

#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:05A1"
msgid "This is forbidden, Lady.  The Ritual of Interment is sacred. "
msgstr ""

#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:0649"
msgid "Do not question my decisions, Tarna.  I am sure that Lithos would not want this one's worthless spirit in his domain. "
msgstr ""

#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:086E"
msgid "Perform your task, Executioner! "
msgstr ""

#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:0AB1"
msgid "My husband... "
msgstr ""

#. event 07 (hatch)
msgctxt "bark 0483:0D92"
msgid "Stand aside! Let Lady Mordea pass! "
msgstr ""
